cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "simtakt"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "MRXhub"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MRXhub/simtakt"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A simulator-neutral orchestration control plane for long-running
  simulation and evaluation workloads: immutable evaluation contracts,
  a pure scheduling function, atomic dispatch, durable SQLite-backed
  attempt/session/allocation state, pluggable simulator worker/gateway
  protocols, and a web status console with a self-contained demo mode.
